      "title": "btle: Fix CRC validation for data channel packets",
      "message": "btle: Fix CRC validation for data channel packets\n\nAdd connection_info lookup in dissect_btle() before calling dissect_crc().\nThe connection_info was always NULL, preventing CRC validation using the\nCRC init from CONNECT_IND for data channel packets.\n",
